      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "            Regular -ar verbs in Spanish conjugate by removing the -ar ending and adding -o, -as, -a, -amos, -an. \nThese drills practise changing between singular and plural forms and responding to questions using the appropriate verb form. \nNote that stress placement remains the same when conjugating, and the theme vowel /a/ recurs throughout.\n"
